    {
      "topic": "G187 Surface Smoothing vs Accuracy",
      "controller_dialect": "Haas Classic (PRE-NGC)",
      "code_example": "G187 P3 E0.0254 (Finish: tight corner tolerance for 3D contour)\nG01 X... Y... Z... F4000\nG187 P1 (Rough: faster corners)",
      "description": "G187 trades corner accuracy against feed-rate continuity. P3 (finish) holds the programmed path tightly for surface quality; P1 (rough) allows corner rounding so the machine does not decelerate at every block. Use E to set the allowable corner-rounding tolerance in inches.",
