    {
      "topic": "G103 Look-Ahead for Macro Synchronization",
      "controller_dialect": "Haas Classic (PRE-NGC)",
      "code_example": "G103 P1 (Force single-block look-ahead so macro reads current position)\n#100 = #5041 (Read live X machine position)\nG103 P0 (Restore full look-ahead for cutting)",
      "description": "By default the Haas control buffers many blocks ahead, so a macro that reads a position variable may read a value many blocks in the future. G103 P1 forces single-block execution so macro position reads are current; restore G103 P0 afterward to regain HSM throughput.",
